  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JUNIOR SECONDARY SCHOOL BUILDING PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;Build a school for rural community&quot; is a project which seeks to provide educational facility for Gandorhun community in the Kpanga Krim Chiefdom, Pujehun District, Southern Sierra Leone, West Africa. The project seeks to put up a 1No. 6-unit Classrooms block, 1No.1-Unit Administrative Block, 2 No. 4-unit VIP latrine rooms and 1No.1 water-well with hand-pump facilities to help improve the social well-being of children from the above mentioned community.</narrative>
  </description>
